      clinicalImportance: 'The CBC is one of the most frequently ordered laboratory tests, essential for detecting anemia, infections, leukemia, bleeding disorders, and monitoring treatment response. Hematology analyzers provide rapid, accurate, and reproducible results that guide clinical decision-making.',
