    description: 'Analyzes arterial blood for pH, partial pressures of oxygen and carbon dioxide, and electrolytes using electrochemical sensors.',
    image: 'https://images.pexels.com/photos/4386466/pexels-photo-4386466.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800',
